    "text": "The Gazettte Notice bearing No. 1966/45 issued on 13th ofMay, 2016 under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the LandAcquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment Act), No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intendsto acquire the lands described the Schedule given below forthe Restoration of Kegalle Bus Depot should be amended asfollows. Accordingly, I hereby give notice under sub section(1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act.",
